  "result_text": "```python\nfrom cyhole.jupiter import Jupiter\nfrom cyhole.jupiter.client import (\n    GetSwapOrderParams,\n    PostSwapExecuteBody,\n    JupiterClient,\n)\n\n# Initialize Jupiter client\njupiter = Jupiter()\nclient = jupiter.client\n\n# Define token addresses\nSOL = \"So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112\"\nUSDC = \"EPjFWaLb3hyccqaB3JgRe8NqtwybKt7H91mM4BmwQmk\"\n\n# Amount to swap (1 SOL in lamports: 1 * 10^9)\namount = 1_000_000_000\n\n# Step 1: Request a swap quote/order\nswap_order_params = GetSwapOrderParams(\n    input_token=SOL,\n    output_token=USDC,\n    amount=amount,\n)\n\nswap_quote = client.get_swap_order(swap_order_params)\nprint(\"Swap Quote Response:\")\nprint(f\"Input: {swap_quote.input_token}\")\nprint(f\"Output: {swap_quote.output_token}\")\nprint(f\"Output Amount: {swap_quote.out_amount}\")\n\n# Step 2: Execute the swap\nswap_execute_body = PostSwapExecuteBody(\n    swap_order=swap_quote,\n)\n\nswap_result = client.post_swap_execute(swap_execute_body)\nprint(\"\\nSwap Execution Result:\")\nprint(f\"Tx ID: {swap_result.tx_id}\")\nprint(f\"Status: {swap_result.status}\")\n```",
